    "title": "City of Verona sets Halloween trick-or-treat hours and shares safety tips",
    "text": "Verona | wikipedia.org\nVerona | wikipedia.org\nThe City of Verona has announced that trick-or-treating for Halloween will take place on October 31 from 5 p.m. to 8 p.m. Residents are encouraged to plan their costumes and routes in advance, and to celebrate the evening safely.\nThe city provided several safety tips for participants. These include approaching only homes with porch lights on, carrying a flashlight, staying on sidewalks when possible, obeying traffic signals, and crossing streets at corners. Drivers are also urged to slow down and be alert for trick-or-treaters during the designated hours.\n\"We look forward to a fun and spooky night in our community!\" the announcement stated.\nThe City of Verona wishes everyone a safe and happy Halloween.",
